NAME
       basename - strip directory and suffix from a name

SYNOPSIS
       basename NAME [SUFFIX]  |  basename -a [-s SUFFIX] [-z]
          NAME...

DESCRIPTION
       Strip directory and suffix from a name.

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

